forth-morse-translator
======================

Morse code translator that encodes text to morse and decodes it back.

* encodes letters (A-Z) and digits (0-9)
* decodes morse back to text
* words separated by ' / '

Usage
-----

Load the code from the repository root:

	gforth src/morse.fs

Encode text to morse:

	to-morse Hi you 42

Decode morse to text:

	from-morse .... .. / -.-- --- ..-
